prompt:
Write a standalone TypeScript ESM program that converts an ArcGIS WebMap JSON document into a MapLibre style using parseWebMap from @honua/sdk-js/webmap. Inline this WebMap JSON in the program exactly as given:

{
  "operationalLayers": [
    {
      "id": "incidents",
      "title": "Incidents",
      "layerType": "ArcGISFeatureLayer",
      "url": "https://example.test/rest/services/EvalIncidents/FeatureServer/0",
      "layerDefinition": {
        "drawingInfo": {
          "renderer": {
            "type": "simple",
            "symbol": { "type": "esriSMS", "style": "esriSMSCircle", "color": [226, 119, 40, 255], "size": 8 }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "baseMap": { "title": "Basemap", "baseMapLayers": [] },
  "version": "2.27"
}

parseWebMap returns { style, warnings, ... } where style is a MapLibre v8 style. Print exactly one line to stdout: {"styleVersion": <style.version>, "layerCount": <style.layers.length>, "sourceCount": <number of keys in style.sources>}.
